This version of the set contains a small fix to the first patch, a change
suggested by Serge to the second, and a new third to avoid leaking the
struct socket object on DEAD sockets.  As previously mentioned, this still
doesn't implement the collect bits for socket objects, which will follow
later.  Note that it depends on the yet-to-be-pushed post-files deferqueue
patch that Oren has accepted.
